msgid "Boost your property"
msgstr "提升您的房产价值"

#: core/components/modals/boost-info-modal.php:20
msgid ""
"The Gold Star Boost Program is an exclusive visibility tool created for \n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tsellers and agents who demand the \"top spot.\" By leveraging your earned Star Points, you can \n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tinstantly transform any standard listing into a featured powerhouse, ensuring your property is \n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\tthe first thing potential buyers see when they start their search."
msgstr ""
"“金星推广计划”是一项专为\n"
"追求“头条位置”的卖家和经纪人打造的独家曝光工具。 通过利用您赚取的星点，您可以\n"
"将任何标准房源瞬间转化为引人注目的明星房源，确保您的房产\n"
"成为潜在买家开始搜索时首先看到的内容。"

#: core/components/modals/boost-info-modal.php:27
msgid "How much does it cost?"
msgstr "这要多少钱？"

#: core/components/modals/boost-info-modal.php:30
msgid ""
"Boost costs are based on your selected timeframe. For example, you can \n"
